// CompilerDB-Driven Semantic Refactoring Transformations & Mandatory Verification Gate (T809 / E19.3).
// Implements SPEC-102 §§1..2 (AXS-REF-001..003, AXS-REF-010..014; REQ-TOOL-183, REQ-TOOL-186):
// - Unified `CompilerDB` semantic authority & post-transformation verification gate (`AXS-REF-001..002`)
// - `extract_function`: ownership (`ByCopy`, `ByMove`), capability (`view<T>`, `mut_view<T>`),
//   return-value tuple, `async`/`.await`, and `! ErrorType` synthesis (`AXS-REF-010`)
// - `extract_variable` & `inline_variable`: evaluation-order, purity, `Copy`, `Drop`,
//   and operator-precedence parenthesization verification (`AXS-REF-011`)
// - `populate_match_arms`: exhaustive pattern matrix expansion (`AXS-REF-012`)
// - `organize_imports`: unused pruning, deduplication, alias preservation & dot-path brace merging (`AXS-REF-013`)
// - `change_signature`, `move_item` & `convert_capability_view` (`AXS-REF-014`)
module compiler.refactor.transforms

